OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne Florida resident tells the BBC that
OL,8,F"everyone's gone", but he's remaining
OL,9,Fin his home, securing his ducks and
OL,10,Fchickens in the bathroom
OL,12,FAn Alabama beach town has instated a
OL,13,Fcurfew - warning residents to stay
OL,14,Findoors until tomorrow
OL,16,FUS President Donald Trump is no longer
OL,17,Fattending a major American football
OL,18,Fcollege game in Tuscaloosa, Alabama
OL,19,Fbecause of the hurricane
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
