OL,3,AJD Vance casts doubt on firing squad
OL,4,Aexecution and says he will not watch it
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has cast
OL,7,Fdoubt on the Pentagon's plans to
OL,8,Flivestream a firing squad execution of
OL,9,Fthe Fort Hood shooter.
OL,11,FTalking with reporters, Vance expressed
OL,12,Fdoubt that the December execution would
OL,13,Fgo forward as planned, saying: "I don't
OL,14,Fknow that that's actually going to
OL,15,Fhappen". He added, that "if it's
OL,16,Fthrough live stream, I'm not going to
OL,17,Fbe watching it".
OL,19,FHours later, US President Donald Trump
OL,20,Fsaid he "absolutely" approved the live
OL,21,Fstream plans but said the Pentagon was
OL,22,Fstill "making a determination" on it.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
